"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Iman itulah pangkal dan ujung segenap wujud. Tanpa Iman, suatupun tiada. Maka, seorang Junzi - Kuncu memuliakan Iman."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.25.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"fēi","traditional":"非","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zì","traditional":"自","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jǐ","traditional":"己","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"已","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"suǒ","traditional":"所","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jǐ","traditional":"己","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wù","traditional":"物","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"xìng","traditional":"性","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"德","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"合","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wài","traditional":"外","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"内","pinyin":"nèi","traditional":"內","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"时","pinyin":"shí","traditional":"時","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cuò","traditional":"措","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yí","traditional":"宜","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Iman itu bukan dimaksudkan selesai dengan menyempurnakan diri sendiri, melainkan menyempurnakan segenap wujud juga. Cinta Kasih itu menyempurnakan diri dan Bijaksana itu menyempurnakan segenap wujud. Inilah Kebajikan Watak Sejati dan inilah Keesaan LuarDalam dari pada Jalan Suci. Maka setiap saat janganlah dilalaikan."}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/25 - Bab XXIV - Iman dan Jalan Suci.md","title":"Bab XXIV — Iman dan Jalan Suci"}
